Package: llm-memory
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: git, nodejs (>= 18), gh
Maintainer: Guilherme Ditzel Patriota <guipatriota@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/guipatriota/llm-memory
Description: Persistent, shared memory for Claude Code sessions
 A private, Git-backed wiki vault that remembers your Claude Code sessions across
 machines: a Stop hook captures every transcript, a scheduled headless run turns
 them into wiki pages, and a weekly lint audits the store. GitHub private
 repositories are the only server needed. Run `llm-memory init` after installing.
